No qualifying word breaks the definition or scenario, so the answer is true.', 'FALSE — Evaluated against the textbook standard, this assertion is false. regional supermarket chains with identical profitability targets must also follow identical product-versus-market orientation processes.

This tests discrimination within product orientation versus market orientation: local versus international scope, equity versus debt, product versus market orientation, and similar pairs.

